msgid "仪表板可视化"
msgstr "Dashboard visualization"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dashboard_viz.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dashboard_viz.rst:9
msgid "仪表板可视化节点用于将带有预测可视化效果的图像输出到 **实时警报仪表板**，实现实时监控和展示。"
msgstr ""
"The dashboard visualization node is used to output images with predictive "
"visualization effects to the **Real-time Alert Dashboard** for real-time "
"monitoring and display."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/dashboard_viz.rst:11
msgid ""
"该节点是可视化流程的终端节点，将经过各种可视化处理后的图像推送到平台的 **实时警报仪表板** 界面，供用户实时查看检测、分类等模型的运行结果。"
msgstr ""
"This node is the terminal node of the visualization process. Images after "
"various visualization processes are pushed to the **Real-time Alert "
"Dashboard** interface of the platform for users to view the running results "
"of detection, classification and other models in real time."

